{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">啟德簡約公屋有女嬰在家中昏迷，意外原因仍在調查。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一歲女嬰被送到廣華醫院治理，女嬰家屬到場了解。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BABY-0730.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026AftuPkcmVb1788998748.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BABY-0730.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在世運道簡約公屋第六座。警方清晨約5時半接到女嬰媽媽報案，指發現女嬰在家中昏迷，沒有呼吸和脈搏，意外原因仍在調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T00:51:25.714722+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}